  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Four rank four demonic Gu Masters, the four great obscenities, press on towards three female Gu Masters while Immortal Crane Sect disciples descend to feed their cranes. Fairy Bi Xia of Heavenly Lotus Sect is among them, seriously injured and without strength to break through, when Fang Zheng leads the crane group down and drives the four off. She thanks young master Fang Zheng for saving her, blushing with infatuation after the rescue. The English chapters used here never print a personal surname beyond the fairy title Bi Xia, and they do not state her Gu Master rank, path, or named Gu worms during that rescue.",
      "chapters": [
        336
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_demonic_path",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has snow-white teeth.",
      "chapters": [
        336
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a great beauty.",
      "chapters": [
        339
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Other ten great sect elites notice that Fairy Bi Xia from Heavenly Lotus Sect came with Immortal Crane Sect and is speaking happily with Fang Zheng. A young man from another sect greets her by name at the Hu Immortal Inheritance, saying he begged his master to come because he expected her there; her smile vanishes when she sees him.",
      "chapters": [
        338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hu-immortal-road-and-admirers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Wu Shang finds her safe beside Fang Zheng and hears her credit the rescue, while Lord Sky Crane warns Fang Zheng that saving Bi Xia has brought enemies because she likes him.",
      "chapters": [
        339
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hu-immortal-road-and-admirers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_wu_shang",
        "char_lord_sky_crane"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei Wu Shang later fights Fang Zheng with Bi Xia watching, transmits that she is his love and that he will not concede, and names four further competitors among her admirers: Heaven River Chen Da Jiang, Rising Purple Lightning Gu Ting, Nine Death Sorrowful Wind Tang Ru Qi, and Tigress Zhao Shu Ye. Gu Ting of Ancient Soul Sect then challenges Fang Zheng after learning of the matter between Fairy Bi Xia and Fang Zheng.",
      "chapters": [
        341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hu-immortal-road-and-admirers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_da_jiang",
        "char_gu_ting",
        "char_tang_ru_qi",
        "char_zhao_shu_ye",
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of Fairy Bi Xia, Gu Yue Fang Zheng did not have an easy time.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-elite-tier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A broader ranking of that generation places disciples like Fang Zheng, Fairy Bi Xia, Gu Ting, and Wei Wu Shang only in the second tier beneath the true hidden talents of the ten great sects.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-elite-tier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Zheng ascends, she watches with a complicated gaze.",
      "chapters": [
        388
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-elite-tier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Much later, Wei Wu Shang is still remembered as once infatuated with Fairy Bi Xia, having fought Fang Zheng and kept a sense of gratitude after a face saving draw.",
      "chapters": [
        909
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-wu-shang-retrospect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A still later recollection by the four great obscenities themselves names Heavenly Lotus Sect’s Fairy Bi Xia as a target they once pressed, and blames Fang Zheng for ruining that attempt.",
      "chapters": [
        2093
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-wu-shang-retrospect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the painting world she is cultivating hard when explosions shake the scene.",
      "chapters": [
        2064
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "divine-emperor-city-painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She appears among the group that Shen Shang calls the ten children of human path, with Xiao Qi Xing at the front and Sun Yuan Hua, Chen Da Jiang, and others beside her. Those ten are Gu Immortal seeds selected from Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects and specially supported to develop human path Gu Immortals, carrying abundant human qi for that work.",
      "chapters": [
        2065
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "divine-emperor-city-painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shen_shang",
        "char_xiao_qi_xing",
        "char_sun_yuan_hua",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, standing beside Zhao Shu Ye at a growling beast painting world camp, she praises Craftsman Gu’s broad use and asks whether he used organization Gu to ease the mental burden of so many craftsmen, which names his worms rather than her own.",
      "chapters": [
        2081
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "divine-emperor-city-painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_craftsman_gu",
        "gu_organization_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
